Incident-02-Phishing Attack
Inbound Email Containing Suspicious External Link

Overview:
A security alert was triggered following detection of an inbound email containing a suspicious external link. 
The investigation aimed to determine whether the activity represented a phishing attempt and required escalation.

Analyst information:
Analyst Role: SOC Level 1 Analyst (Simulation)
Investigation Environment: TryHackMe Lab Environment
Alert Severity: Medium
Time to Resolve: 4.23 minutes
Investigation Date: 13 May 2026


Alert details:
Alert Name: Inbound Email Containing Suspicious External Link
