Investigation process:
Alert review
Reviewed alert information and affected mailbox.
Confirmed alert originated from email security monitoring system.

Email Content analysis
Examined sender and email structure.
Identified suspicious username pattern containing numeric characters inconsistent with legitimate corporate email conventions.

URL verification:
